  "history": "The 2013 thesis points to www.mpi-inf.mpg.de/~tianlu/fmPastry/. The 2013-07-25 Wayback index references fm.html. The retrieved successful-capture index listed only the home page and tools.html. The 2016 LuPastry+ proof archive explicitly describes subsequent revisions. The 2015 author paper, doi:10.1007/978-3-319-25942-0_19 reference 10, names tiit.lu/fmPastry/. The live URL returned 404 and the Wayback CDX prefix query returned no successful captures.",
  "comparison": "Dedicated c7i.4xlarge, us-east-2. Each process pinned to one logical CPU. Probe groups used different CPU affinities and could overlap others on this instance. Timing fields are GNU time wall seconds and RSS KiB; Java and Dive timings include process startup. Frontend comparison starts a new process per edit. Semantic analysis does not reprove theorems.",
