    "bounded_edit": "In SharedDigitsAux replace the commented binder after CHOOSE g by its active expression \\in [RTRows -> 0..RTRowCount]. Retain the function equation.",
    "counted_definition": "SharedDigitsAux(i,j) == [n \\in RTRows |-> Cardinality({k \\in 1..n : IthDigit(i, RTRowCount-k+1) = IthDigit(j, RTRowCount-k+1)})]",
    "error_edit": "Change TheBetterNode(i,j) == j to TheBetterNode(i,j) == MissingRoutingResult(j) in RoutingTable.tla.",
